<title>USA: Investor holds 5.4 pct Halsey Drug stake.</title>
<headline>Investor holds 5.4 pct Halsey Drug stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>William Priest, a New York-based investor, said Friday he holds a 5.4 percent stake or 540,500 common shares in Halsey Drug Co Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Priest said he holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
<p>Priest is chief executive officer of BEA Associates, a New York based investment management firm.</p>
</text>
